   "consequence": "Same as state_abstraction_ignores_ids."
  },
  {
   "id": "float_safe_weak_open_shut_move",
   "status": "out-of-scope",
   "statement": "MOVE, OPEN/SHUT, WEAK, FLOAT, SAFE, HAS, conditions (ON/NEAR/FACING/LONELY), NOT and the special nouns are implemented by the engine (and the solver handles them, since it runs the engine) but have no probe in this blueprint yet.",
   "consequence": "They are accepted in hand-written levels and verified by the solver, but the generator will not emit them."
